  "content": {
    "id": "p24-q4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "The probability that a biased coin lands on heads is $\\frac{3}{5}$. Three such coins are placed in a bag with four regular coins. A coin is randomly chosen from the bag and tossed. It lands on heads. Find the probability that the coin was biased.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p24-q4-short-result",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\frac{9}{19}",
                "display": false
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p24-q4-short-method",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Divide the probability of choosing a biased coin and obtaining heads by the total probability of obtaining heads.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Let $B$ denote choosing a biased coin and $H$ denote obtaining heads. A regular coin is fair.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Pr(B\\cap H)&=\\frac{3}{7}\\times\\frac{3}{5}\\\\\\Pr(B\\cap H)&=\\frac{9}{35}\\\\\\Pr(B'\\cap H)&=\\frac{4}{7}\\times\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\Pr(B'\\cap H)&=\\frac{2}{7}\\\\\\Pr(H)&=\\frac{9}{35}+\\frac{2}{7}\\\\\\Pr(H)&=\\frac{19}{35}\\\\\\Pr(B\\mid H)&=\\frac{\\Pr(B\\cap H)}{\\Pr(H)}\\\\\\Pr(B\\mid H)&=\\frac{9/35}{19/35}\\\\\\Pr(B\\mid H)&=\\frac{9}{19}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 58
  },
